{"id":561138,"slug":"24-hodin-2001","title":"24 hodin","title_en":"24","year":2001,"rating":68,"votes_count":11458,"runtime_min":null,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"seriál","vod_date":null,"plot":"Seriál 24 hodin se odehrává v reálném čase jednoho dne. Každá epizoda pokrývá časový úsek jedné hodiny, takže se celý příběh, rozdělený do čtyřiadvaceti dílů, odehraje během jednoho jediného dne. Za tuto dobu se protiteroristický agent Jack Bauer z losangeleského Protiteroristického oddělení (PTO, angl. CTU - Counter Terrorist Unit) vždy snaží předejít nějaké katastrofě s globálními politickými následky, osvobodit rukojmí a zachránit své nejbližší.(oficiální text distributora)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iq6yrZ5LEDXf1ArCOYLq8PIUBpV.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/be6mDIMv7cg8duWkcYVnTB8rphO.jpg","trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Akční","Drama","Krimi","Thriller"],"tags":["vražda","pomsta","politika","únos","zabijáci","agenti","vydírání","rukojmí","konspirace","teroristé","špioni","nájemný vrah","mučení","bomba","prezident","CIA"],"countries":["USA"],"directors":["Jon Cassar","Brad Turner","Milan Cheylov","Bryan Spicer","Stephen Hopkins","Ian Toynton","Frederick King Keller","James Whitmore Jr.","Tim Iacofano","Kevin Hooks","Michael Klick","Rodney Charters","Joseph A. Hodges","Winrich Kolbe","Davis Guggenheim","Paul Shapiro","Ken Girotti","Dwight H. Little","Nelson McCormick"],"actors":["Kiefer Sutherland","Mary Lynn Rajskub","Carlos Bernard","Elisha Cuthbert","James Morrison","Sarah Clarke","Leslie Hope","Sarah Wynter","Xander Berkeley","Željko Ivanek","Jude Ciccolella","Penny Johnson Jerald","Roger Cross","Gregory Itzin","Kari Matchett","Carlo Rota","Jon Voight","Zachary Quinto","Paul Schulze","James Badge Dale","Gina Torres","Rhys Coiro","Misha Collins","Aisha Tyler","Alexandra Lydon","Jim Holmes","Kevin Alejandro","Martin Papazian","Navi Rawat","Logan Marshall-Green","Gregory Sporleder","Rena Sofer","James Frain","Dameon Clarke","